    {
      "id": "edition-notice",
      "zh": [
        {
          "type": "block",
          "kind": "notice",
          "children": [
            "本稿据查尔斯·蒂利英文著作翻译校订。底本版权页记1990年初版、1992年修订平装版，印次行为“19 2008”。本书“今天”“目前”等时局表述属于原书出版时的语境，第七章结尾明确写于1992年春，未改写为现况。英文为校订抽取文本；原作表注、来源说明与本稿编者注分别标明。原页码及索引数字指英文原书，不是本阅读版页码。参考文献与索引保留英文原页影像及检索文本，未另译。AI辅助翻译与校订；原著权利归原权利人，本稿不作出版社授权版本声明。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "en": [
        {
          "type": "block",
          "kind": "notice",
          "children": [
            "This reading edition was translated and reviewed from Charles Tilly’s English text. The source copyright page records first publication in 1990, the revised paperback edition in 1992, and the printing line “19 2008.” Contemporary references retain the original historical context; the end of chapter 7 explicitly speaks from spring 1992. The English text is a reviewed extraction. Original table notes and sources are distinguished from editorial notes. Original page markers and index numbers refer to the English book, not this edition’s pagination. References and index are retained as English facsimiles with searchable extracted text, not translated. Translation and review were AI-assisted. Original rights remain with the rights holders; no publisher authorization is claimed."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "canonical_kind": "editorial_notice",
      "page": ""
    },
