    {
      "id": "front-series-01",
      "page": "",
      "zh": [
        {
          "type": "block",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            "《社会不连续性研究》丛书于1972年创办，最初由学术出版社（Academic Press）出版。头15年中，丛书共出版53种，包括历史社会学、政治经济学和社会史领域的重要著作。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "en": [
        {
          "type": "block",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            "Studies in Social Discontinuity began in 1972 under the imprint of Academic Press. In its first 15 years, 53 titles were published in the series, including important volumes in the areas of historical sociology, political economy, and social history."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "canonical_kind": "para",
      "source_ids": [
        "front-series-01"
      ],
      "shared": false
    },
    {
      "id": "front-series-02",
      "page": "",
      "zh": [
        {
          "type": "block",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            "1989年，布莱克韦尔出版社重启本丛书。丛书将继续收入侧重社会变迁与非西方历史经验的著作，以及重要著作的译本。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "en": [
        {
          "type": "block",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            "Revived in 1989 by Blackwell Publishers, the series will continue to include volumes emphasizing social changes and non-Western historical experience as well as translations of major works."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "canonical_kind": "para",
      "source_ids": [
        "front-series-02"
      ],
      "shared": false
